+# AI2 – ChatGPT → Node → Server → GitHub
+
+**Token file**: `/home/genweb/agent/ACTION_TOKEN`
+
+**Endpoints**
+- `GET  /ai2/fs/list?path=&depth=` — list files/folders (depth ≤ 3, hidden/system dirs filtered)
+- `GET  /ai2/fs/get?path=` — return `{content_b64,...}` for a file (≤ 256KB)
+- `POST /ai2` — enqueue a patch job `{ base_branch, message, diff | diff_b64 }`
+
+**Tips**
+- Prefer `diff_b64` to avoid newline issues.
+- Use repo-relative paths (no `./`).
+- For brand new files, diff against `/dev/null` or make a tracked-style diff.
+- The worker will apply with `git apply --index --3way` (fallbacks), commit, push.
+
+**Quick tests**
+```bash
+TOKEN="$(cat /home/genweb/agent/ACTION_TOKEN)"
+curl -sS -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" "https://datav.belocloud.com/ai2/fs/list?depth=1" | jq .
+
+curl -sS -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \
+  "https://datav.belocloud.com/ai2/fs/get?path=ai2/README.md" | jq -r .content_b64 | base64 -d | head
+
+curl -sS -X POST "https://datav.belocloud.com/ai2" \
+  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{"base_branch":"main","message":"noop test","diff_b64":"ZGlmZiAtLWdpdCBhL3Rlc3QudHh0IGIvdGVzdC50eHQKLS0tIC9kZXYvbnVsbAorKysgYi90ZXN0LnR4dAorK0BAbmV3IGZpbGUKK2hlbGxvIHdvcmxkCg=="}'
+```
